   "text": "Patient Information",
   "class": "section-heading"
  },
  {
   "type": "p",
   "text": "Appointment",
   "md": "**Appointment**"
  },
  {
   "type": "p",
   "text": "The first step towards a beautiful, healthy smile is to schedule an appointment. Please contact our office by phone or complete an online appointment request.",
   "md": "The first step towards a beautiful, healthy smile is to [schedule an appointment](https://www.porterfamilydentistry.com/patient-information/AppointmentRequest.aspx). Please contact our office by phone or complete an online appointment request.",
   "links": [
    {
     "text": "schedule an appointment",
     "href": "https://www.porterfamilydentistry.com/patient-information/AppointmentRequest.aspx"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "p",
   "text": "Payment Options",
   "md": "**Payment Options**"
  },
  {
   "type": "p",
   "text": "For your convenience, we accept cash, personal checks, debit cards, and most major credit cards. Payment is expected at the time services are performed. Feel free to contact our office if your treatment plan requires more comprehensive dental work and you want to discuss financial arrangements."
  },
