  {
   "type": "p",
   "text": "Dental Insurance",
   "md": "**Dental Insurance**"
  },
  {
   "type": "p",
   "text": "While dental insurance is a necessity these days, insurance companies don't always have your best interests in mind. That is why our dedicated staff is here to fight for your rights during every step of the process. Let us be your dental insurance advocate."
  },
  {
   "type": "p",
   "text": "We are able to work with ALL insurance plans, and always strive to help you save as much money as possible, receiving every last penny from your insurance plan. Please contact our office for insurance details. We look forward to hearing from you.",
   "md": "We are able to work with ALL insurance plans, and always strive to help you save as much money as possible, receiving every last penny from your insurance plan. Please [contact](https://www.porterfamilydentistry.com/patient-information/ContactUs.aspx) our office for insurance details. We look forward to hearing from you.",
